\paragraph{Conclusion.}
VLA fine-tuning redistributes instruction attention to entry-exit layers with L1 as the primary hub, consistent across two causal-decoder VLAs and supported by seven complementary analyses.
Training effects concentrate at the readout rather than image geometry, with a consistent reorganization pattern across both architectures studied. Code and data will be released upon acceptance.

